{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And it was uncovered.</b> The covering of Judah was already uncovered, and the meaning is that when the enemy came they saw that they had no strength to bear it. It is also possible that ויגל is a divine name." "<b>And you looked.</b> It returns to Judah, who looked at the weapons."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:36.047261687Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}